  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An electron is accelerated from rest through a potential difference of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the de Broglie wavelength of the electron?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h}{\\sqrt{eVm_{e}}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2h}{\\sqrt{eVm_{e}}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h}{2\\sqrt{eVm_{e}}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h}{\\sqrt{2eVm_{e}}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
